    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Love, Blades, and Run</i></strong> is a high-mobility parkour game where style is survival and freedom is everything. You play as a masked urban rebel in a city that wants to cage your soul. Run, swing, wall-run, and slash your way through an oppressive regime while uncovering a hidden story of truth, justice, and personal liberation. <br> <br>Feel the movement-driven combat, stylish traversal, and identity-defining choices that shape the full game. Whether you're sprinting across rooftops, dueling enforcers mid-air, or defacing propaganda with your own flair, this is your invitation to rebel\u2014with elegance.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Love, Blades, and Run</i></strong> is a high-mobility parkour game where style is survival and freedom is everything. You play as a masked urban rebel in a city that wants to cage your soul. Run, swing, wall-run, and slash your way through an oppressive regime while uncovering a hidden story of truth, justice, and personal liberation. <br> <br>Feel the movement-driven combat, stylish traversal, and identity-defining choices that shape the full game. Whether you're sprinting across rooftops, dueling enforcers mid-air, or defacing propaganda with your own flair, this is your invitation to rebel\u2014with elegance.</p>",
